# QuickScout X - AI Tactical Match Engine

An intelligent cricket tactical analysis tool powered by Google Gemini AI and deployed on Google Cloud Run.

## Features
- AI-powered opponent analysis using Gemini
- Tactical intelligence and strategy recommendations
- Match situation analysis
- Deployed on Google Cloud Run
- Real-time database storage with Firestore

## Tech Stack
- **Frontend**: Streamlit
- **AI**: Google Generative AI (Gemini)
- **Database**: Google Cloud Firestore
- **Deployment**: Google Cloud Run

## Live Demo
https://quickscout-x-398076176290.us-central1.run.app

## Setup
1. Install dependencies: `pip install -r requirements.txt`
2. Add Gemini API key to `.streamlit/secrets.toml`
3. Run: `streamlit run app.py`

## Build & Blog Marathon 2025
This project was built for the Google Build and Blog Marathon 2025.


